{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12204360","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12204360","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"narration:4:1220436001:0":{"text":"あなたたちがスタントンのために奔走していた時、胴元の用心棒も彼に接触していた……","source_cn":"在你们为斯坦顿奔走之时，庄家的打手也找上了这位年轻的拳手……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAD6FC4DF11748F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220436002:0":{"text":"……実を言えば、ボスだってこんな騒ぎを起こしたくなかったんだ。お前が意固地なせいだぞ。","source_cn":"……不瞒你说，之前闹成这样，大老板也不想，谁让你那么固执呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EA6EAD79F48528E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1220436003:0":{"text":"何が言いたい？","source_cn":"你们到底想说什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3AEB8BB040545DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1220436004:0":{"text":"ボスはな……これからの三試合もお前に八百長してほしいそうだ。","source_cn":"大老板的意思呢，是让你最近这三场拳赛再放放水。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFCDA3962114686C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220436005:0":{"text":"はぁ？この前は一度でいいって言ってたじゃねぇか！","source_cn":"什么？你们上次说只打一场假拳的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7D17441FA1AB6A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220436006:0":{"text":"なぁ、ボスはお前を買ってるんだ。あと数試合戦ったら、仲間に入れてくれるってよ。","source_cn":"兄弟，大老板很看好你。他的意思是，这几场拳赛打完，你就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FF2F46A650A496D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1220436007:0":{"text":"そうすりゃお前は大金持ちになっていい暮らしを送れる。お前の妹も、誰にもちょっかいをかけられなくなる。","source_cn":"以后你跟着大老板赚大钱，吃香喝辣，你妹妹自然也是没人敢...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD46FC426EF244788","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1220436008:0":{"text":"そうだぞ！もう戦わなくてよくなる……","source_cn":"就是！以后就不用再打拳赛了，又累又苦，又不赚钱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x495FD272D6CA1449","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1220436009:0":{"text":"そんなにいい条件を？妹は……","source_cn":"你们会这么好心？我妹妹……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55EC8ED2F98B49FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1220436010:0":{"text":"お前が首を縦に振れば、三試合後に妹を解放してやる。傷一つつけずに、だ！","source_cn":"只要你点头，打完这三场拳赛，我们就把你妹妹送回来，保证...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAD7EA35BF4A5781","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1